<urn:atm:triage:finding/RSH-008>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RSH-008" ;
  triage:title "join_tracked_dispatches() unreachable on force-cancel error path — threads abandoned" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/local_ipc_transport.rs — join_tracked_dispatches() call is unreachable when the force-cancel deadline fires (return Err at :547 executes first, before join_tracked_dispatches at :551). On forced shutdown, tracked dispatch threads are abandoned rather than joined. Partially related to RSH-002 (JoinHandle tracking added but join path blocked). File unchanged from bcb5aab through 4176880 — fix deferred, still open. (quality-mgr reported as RSH-004 in S.2 QA-2 report; remapped RSH-008 to avoid conflict; confirmed STILL_OPEN in S.2 QA-4 at 4176880.)" ;
  triage:category "RSH" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-S" ;
